    "chunk_text": "liemed, & he self & ealle \u00fea men Iulius het ofslean \u00fee \u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6re lare w\u00e6ron \u00fe\u00e6t mon Pompeius ofslog. & he swa\u00feeah eft forlet Phtolomeus to his rice. \u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m Iulius gefeaht wi\u00f0 Phtolomeus \u00feriwa, & \u00e6t \u00e6lcum cirre sige h\u00e6fde. \u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m gefeohte ealle Egypti wurdon Iuliuse under\u00feeowas. & he him si\u00fe\u00fean hwearf to Rome, & eft sette senatus, & hiene seolfne mon gesette \u00fe\u00e6t he w\u00e6s \u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m he for on Affrice \u00e6fter Caton \u00fe\u00e6m consule. \u00dea he \u00fe\u00e6t geascade, \u00fea l\u00e6rde he his sunu \u00fe\u00e6t he him ongean fore, & hiene him to fri\u00f0e gesohte; \u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m wordum he eode to \u00fe\u00e6re burge wealle, & fleah ut ofer, \u00fe\u00e6t he eall tob\u00e6rst. Ac \u00fea Iulius to \u00fe\u00e6re byrig com, he him w\u00e6s swi\u00fee waniende \u00fe\u00e6t he to him cucan ne com, & \u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m Iulius gefeaht wi\u00f0 Pompeiuses nefan & wi\u00f0 monige his m\u00e6gas, & hie ealle ofslog. & si\u00fe\u00fean to Rome for, & \u00fe\u00e6r w\u00e6s swa onddrysne \u00fe\u00e6t him mon dyde feower si\u00fean \u00feone Si\u00fe\u00fean he for on Ispanie, & gefeaht wi\u00f0 Pompeiuses tw\u00e6m sunum; & \u00fe\u00e6r w\u00e6s his folc swa \u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m he com to Rome, & ealle \u00fea gesetnessa \u00fee \u00fe\u00e6r to stronge w\u00e6ron & to hearde he hie Hit \u00fea eallum \u00fe\u00e6m senatum of\u00feyncendum & \u00fe\u00e6m consulum \u00fe\u00e6t he heora ealdan gesetnessa \u00deara wunda",
